---
import '@/styles/global.css';

type Props = {
  title: string;
  width: number;
  height: number;
};

const { title, width, height } = Astro.props;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>{title} | SNSテンプレート</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://rsms.me/" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://rsms.me/inter/inter.css" />
    <style define:vars={{ w: `${width}px`, h: `${height}px` }}>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
      }
      html, body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #1a1a1a;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      body {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        padding: 24px 0;
      }
      .sns-help {
        max-width: var(--w);
        padding: 12px 16px;
        background: #0b0c10;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        border-radius: 12px;
        color: #c7cbde;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      }
      .sns-help code {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        padding: 2px 6px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        color: #fbbf24;
      }
      .sns-canvas {
        width: var(--w);
        height: var(--h);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, 'Hiragino Sans', 'Yu Gothic', sans-serif;
      }
      @media print {
        .sns-help { display: none !important; }
        body { background: transparent !important; padding: 0 !important; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="sns-help">
      スクショの取り方：DevTools を開く（F12）→ 要素タブで <code>div#canvas</code> を右クリック → <strong>Capture node screenshot</strong>。等倍のPNGが保存されます。
    </div>
    <div id="canvas" class="sns-canvas">
      <slot />
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
